RATES
FACaO
-mybasic 
-start 
# Parameters
# 1 K1 1.5
# 2 N1 0.7
# 3 K2 0.05
# 4 K3 1.1
# 5 N3 3.3
# 6 Hx
# 7 EA
# 8 EAT
